{"reviews":[{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-0","r":2.0,"t":"Not great...","x":"Disappointing. I was looking for easy-to-use clips to section hair while curling. These simply don't have any 'grip'. I have relatively fine, soft hair \u2014 and these just take multiple tries to keep sections up. I'll put one in and seconds later, hair begins to come undone.  They look and feel nice, but really don't work that great.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent gripping clips","x":"These clips have tremendous gripping quality.  They stay put on one's head without shifting.  I only wish they would come in a more attractive style rather than just utilitarian (i.e. hairdresser's product rather than beauty product).","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Good for fine hair","x":"Read product description for size - they are not very long. They hold my thin hair well as long as I don\u2019t section off too much.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Multipurpose & Durable","x":"I bought these for hair curling, but have ended up using them for other purposes. These are great for when I\u2019m washing my face and just want to gather my hair up for a short amount of time - I just use the one as a clip and there\u2019s no hair tear.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Love these","x":"These are awesome. They slide in and out of my hair without getting tangled, but they also hold it securely. The purple color faded in some places when I used them to color my hair, but the coating that makes them feel nice to use stayed intact.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Holds tight","x":"I have used a lot of chippies, over the years and these are quit nice. They hold the hair in place, I gave my granddaughter a perm and she has thick, long hair. They really did a good job.  I was surprised and pleased.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-6","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE! LOVE! LOVE!","x":"i really wanted something good to clip back my hair when i do makeup and when i do my hair so i can section them off. they\u2019re like a pick of 16 and they\u2019re extremely sturdy! plus the color is really pretty so I LOOOOOVE. they look great and work great!!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great clips for hairdressers","x":"These clips are great for hairdressing, as they are TENSION clips made to hold small sections of hair tight to the scalp to pin it away from the area that you are working on. Best for highlighting and curling. If you are looking for clips to hold lots of hair, try alligator clips.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great clips for hairdressers","x":"These clips are great for hairdressing, as they are TENSION clips made to hold small sections of hair tight to the scalp to pin it away from the area that you are working on. Best for highlighting and curling. If you are looking for clips to hold lots of hair, try alligator clips.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-9","r":5.0,"t":"It\u2019s a must buy","x":"If you\u2019re a hairstylist, these clips are amazing to hold foils! Not only that they\u2019re sturdy, the color makes it super cute & fun! Would def purchase again.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-10","r":3.0,"t":"It\u2019s ok. Don\u2019t expect much","x":"Not easy to use when working with wet hair and the color rubs off","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-11","r":1.0,"t":"Purple paint flakes off","x":"The purple paint flakes off in tiny pieces all through your hair. I read this happened to someone else, so I bought the silver ones - but the purple came. Not happy. I'm not spending more than they are worth to send them back. I'll go to Ulta or Sally's so I can be sure to get UNpainted.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great Value","x":"I\u2019ve used them for a month at the salon now and they\u2019re pretty sturdy. The paint is starting to fade off but I expected that. They work great for sectioning though. Unless you\u2019re trying to hold up a lot of hair then you may need a big claw clip for that.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-13","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome clips for mid-way styling or color","x":"These are very pretty and functional. I use them for doing my hair up or curl it.  And I just did a little bit of color from quarantine boredom, and these were very useful to clip off the parts of hair I didn\u2019t want to color.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great item","x":"Love the color, great value for number of items so even if I lose some or break a couple I have lots to spare! Holds my hair in place while I style it, definitely does it\u2019s job!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Holds hair well","x":"I bought these to keep my hair out of my face when putting on makeup.  Like these much better than a hair band, they do not slip off like a hair band does.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great little clips!!","x":"These are working exactly as I\u2019d hoped! I use them an home to keep sections of hair out of the way while blow drying. Love the purple color!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-17","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"Received 6 out of the 12 it was suppose to come with. After one use the purple came off and a couple of them rusted. Don't waste your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-18","r":5.0,"t":"Highly recommend from a Hairstylist point of view!!","x":"These are amazing!!!! Gorgeous! Strong! and comes in neat snap case to keep them in. I love them in my salon!!! Get them!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Thrilled","x":"I am thrilled to find these clips in my favorite color and in such good quality. Thank you \ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc\u2764\ufe0f\u2764\ufe0f\u2764\ufe0f","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-20","r":1.0,"t":"Very bad quality","x":"Horrible product!!! None of them close properly. Don\u2019t waste your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-21","r":3.0,"t":"Color","x":"Color wears off of clips. Love the clips other wise","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-22","r":3.0,"t":"The clips have a hard time holding up hair!","x":"The clips have a hard time holding up hair!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-23","r":3.0,"t":"Good clips, but be aware the purple comes off!","x":"These in theory should be great. A really good dupe for high end salon clips. I like everything about these clips. But if you wash/disinfect them (like you do if you work on clients with them) the purple rubs off & they look like crap. The purple came off almost right away when water touched it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07X5LXMGQ-24","r":1.0,"t":"Color came out !","x":"The color came out the first week I had them! When I cleaned them the color scraped right off and left some weird looking kind of plastic on them I don\u2019t even like to use them cause it rubs off on the hair ! They were cute though!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Most reviewers find the clips hold hair securely and stay in place while styling or sectioning.","cites":[2,3,5,6,7,8,9,10,13,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the value, sturdiness, and attractive color of the clips.","cites":[7,10,13,14,15]},{"text":"A recurring complaint is that the purple paint or color fades, flakes, or rubs off.","cites":[5,11,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the clips work best for small sections and may not hold large amounts of hair.","cites":[3,8,9,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the clips lack grip or are hard to use, especially on fine or wet hair.","cites":[1,11]}]},"qa":[]}